Use the field chapter.
Use the scene chapter.

Prepare.

Whenever Input becomes ready:
  If Input's action is "left":
    Move by -8 toward 0.
  If Input's action is "right":
    Move by 8 toward 0.
  If Input's action is "up":
    Move by 0 toward -8.
  If Input's action is "down":
    Move by 0 toward 8.
  Set Input's action to "".

Ask the model "Give a short Field Lab calibration message." and let the message (text) be the reply.
If the message is "":
  Set Practice's field note to "No calibration message received.".
Otherwise:
  Set Practice's field note to the message.

